  "title": "SPEC-MAT-002A — Material Receipt, Quarantine & Quality Status Events",
  "description": "Document 113 event contract for the events app/modules/material/commands.py actually emits for Document 19. 8 of the catalogue's 9 declared events are implemented: MaterialReceived, MaterialQuarantined, SamplingOrdered, SampleCollected, MaterialReleased, MaterialRejected (mutually exclusive outcomes of the same disposition call site), MaterialRetestRequired, ReceiptDiscrepancyRaised (mutually exclusive with MaterialQuarantined on the same call site, chosen by whether a lot_id was resolved). MaterialQCCompleted is declared but has no producing code path -- QC completion for a material lot is represented through qc_result/QCResultRecorded (Document 23) rather than a distinct material-side event. Verified directly against source.",
  "x-requirement-ids": [
    "MAT-FR-001",
